Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see how Digital Brain turns a short library note into a graph, using
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,simple phases and a repeatable run of our project.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,The library app uses a book list. A help guide explains the app. The
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.15,0:00:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,book list is a small data store. These notes provide evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.20,0:00:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark It Down reads uploaded files. Python finds documents and sections.\NEach item becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,a node; a connection is an edge. Meaning links come later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Optional OpenAI or Claude enrichment finds key items: library app and book\Nlist. It
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.94,0:00:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,proposes their uses connection, item types, source identifier, and exact\Nquote. Similar connection words
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.68,0:00:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,get one standard label.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The server checks the quote, named items, and allowed types. An invented\Ntoy-list quote
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:01:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,is rejected because it is absent from the note. These filters reduce\Nerrors; they
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.57,0:01:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,do not prove every interpretation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.20,0:01:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Both notes refer to one library app, so matching names are merged. Every\Nconnection
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.28,0:01:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,keeps its source, quote, and content fingerprint to detect later changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Our actual builder run accepts two meaning links, merges the shared app,\Nand rejects
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.13,0:01:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,the invented quote. AI proposals are controlled here; no live model call is\Nmade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Django saves a numbered draft. Review quality and evidence. Graphify groups\Nexisting connected nodes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,using Network X and Leiden clustering; it does not invent facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.20,0:01:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,A person publishes the reviewed graph. Answers check current evidence and\Nviewer access. Restricted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.51,0:01:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,sources stay outside AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.20,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,A graph connects useful items and keeps their original evidence. AI\Nsuggests links. The
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,application checks them. A person reviews and publishes.